Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.38,0:02:41.10,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,想·做·想做·什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.10,0:02:43.85,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,想亲手尝试的事有很多！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.88,0:02:46.10,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,很・多・都・想・做！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.35,0:02:51.06,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,哭鼻子是不能解决问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.27,0:02:55.23,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,用心中的橡皮拭去眼泪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.06,0:03:00.43,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.82,0:03:00.03,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Metamorphose！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.20,0:03:04.63,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,为梦想而生
