Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.15,0:03:04.55,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Two！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.92,0:03:05.72,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Three！Four！Five！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.87,0:03:10.00,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,飞翔吧 努力的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.06,0:03:09.38,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Five！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.63,0:03:10.03,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Four！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.43,0:03:11.27,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Three！Two！One！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.29,0:03:15.75,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,未来不是只论成败
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.09,0:03:19.13,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,描绘自己的明天吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.69,0:03:21.09,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！
